This product contains an unofficial specification of the CSV export format used
by My Stocks Portfolio & Market, together with an independently written reference
parser for that format.

"My Stocks Portfolio", "MSP", and "Peeksoft" are trademarks of their respective
owners. This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or
supported by Peeksoft LLC. Those names appear here solely to identify the file
format this project reads.

The specification was derived entirely from CSV files exported by the
application's own export feature, from the author's own account, containing only
the author's own data, together with the vendor's publicly published help pages
and translation strings. No application binary was decompiled or disassembled,
and no code or assets from the application are reproduced here.
